# CODEX MASTER PROMPT

## LINEAGE / FAMILY TREE — COMPLETE MIGRATION TO FIREBASE AND TOTAL REMOVAL OF RENDER

Act as a principal Firebase architect, senior full-stack engineer, Node.js engineer, Firestore data-model specialist, authentication engineer, cloud migration engineer, security engineer, and production deployment engineer.

Repository:

```text
https://github.com/JuniorCarti/family_tree.git
```

Production:

```text
https://family-tree-a4c4f.web.app/
```

Local project:

```text
~/Desktop/Projects/family_tree
```

A previous production investigation established that the application currently depends on a backend connected to Render PostgreSQL and that the database is no longer available.

The architectural decision is now FINAL:

# REMOVE RENDER COMPLETELY.

Do not restore Render as a permanent service.

Do not create another Render database.

Do not keep PostgreSQL as the production database.

Do not keep Cloud Run merely to preserve the old Express/PostgreSQL architecture unless a temporary migration-only use is absolutely required.

The finished application must be Firebase-native.

---

# 1. FINAL TARGET ARCHITECTURE

The production application should become:

```text
                         USERS
                           │
                           ▼
                ┌─────────────────────┐
                │  Firebase Hosting   │
                │ family-tree-a4c4f   │
                └──────────┬──────────┘
                           │
              ┌────────────┴────────────┐
              │                         │
              ▼                         ▼
     Firebase Authentication       Frontend
              │
              │ ID token
              ▼
       Firebase Functions
          2nd Generation
              │
      ┌───────┼─────────┐
      │       │         │
      ▼       ▼         ▼
 Firestore   Storage   Admin SDK
   Data      Photos
```

The final runtime architecture must use:

```text
Firebase Hosting
Firebase Authentication
Cloud Firestore
Cloud Storage for Firebase
Firebase Cloud Functions 2nd Gen
Firebase Admin SDK
Firebase Security Rules
```

The final architecture must NOT require:

```text
Render
Render PostgreSQL
PostgreSQL
DATABASE_URL
pg
pg-pool
connect-pg-simple
PostgreSQL session tables
Render environment variables
Render deployments
Cloud Run PostgreSQL backend
```

