```text
main
feature/tree-exploration-system
migration/firebase-native
incident branches
other relevant feature branches
remote branches
recent commits
```

Determine:

```text
CURRENT MAIN:
CURRENT MIGRATION BRANCH:
LATEST INTENDED APPLICATION:
DEPLOYED FRONTEND REVISION:
DEPLOYED BACKEND REVISION:
```

The Firebase migration must start from the most complete intended application, including the previous blank-page recovery fixes.

Do not accidentally migrate an obsolete version of Lineage.

