# 10. FIREBASE FUNCTIONS

Move required server-side logic to:

```text
functions/
```

Prefer Firebase Functions 2nd Gen.

Suggested structure:

```text
functions/
    package.json
    src/
        index.js

        middleware/
            authenticate.js

        repositories/
            users.js
            trees.js
            persons.js
            relationships.js

        services/
            treeService.js
            personService.js
            relationshipService.js

        routes/
            auth.js
            tree.js
            persons.js
            relationships.js
            upload.js
```

Do not over-engineer.

If the current Express server can be cleanly adapted:

```javascript
exports.api = onRequest(app);
```

is acceptable.

But eliminate all PostgreSQL dependencies.

