The most important requirement is:

# THE FINISHED LINEAGE APPLICATION MUST RUN ENTIRELY ON FIREBASE AND MUST NOT REQUIRE RENDER OR POSTGRESQL TO FUNCTION.

Any old Render access may only be used as a one-time source for recovering historical data. It must never remain a runtime dependency of the finished system.
